Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:06.24,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,800,4200,5000)\pos(640,474.667)}Episode 66\N\N\N\N\NPath Sought in Dire Straits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor. Chancellor Zhuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:39.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo, once again released by Zhuge Liang, still refused to yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:42.00,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He made a plan by sending his brother, Meng You,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to the Shu-Han camp with gifts to fake a surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:48.96,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, anticipating this, made a counterplan to trick to Meng You
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:54.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,by inviting him to a banquet, then setting up an ambush to intercept Meng Huo's raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:50.71,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.333,404)}Zhāng Yí\NStyled: Bóqí
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:55.15,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.667,509.333)}Mǎ Zhōng\NStyled: Déxìn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:12.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(353.333,566.667)}Mèng Huò
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother! Third Brother!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak! What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, drink-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, take'em all back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just as our chancellor predicted!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo, you barbarian, surrender at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312,497.333)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! Retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Quick! Set sail immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, or you will be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.667,517.333)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:06.07,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978.667,570.667)}Mèng Yōu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Loosen his bonds.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.86,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng You, it's rare for both of you brothers to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:28.43,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,482.667)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You two must be tired from these last few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This Chancellor has prepared wine and rest for you at the tent,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,would this be acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them to the rear tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, it seems there are no guards outside the tent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,only a few horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All is quiet in the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.41,0:05:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not take this chance to flee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:30.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,It may be another of Zhuge Liang's tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Second brother! Running is our only chance of survival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay, and it'll be certain death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Wake them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up, let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our chancellor has welcomed you generously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you two leaving without farewell?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.75,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(319.251,504.121)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are your manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If the King of the South insists on leaving, our chancellor can't force you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,King of the South, please be on your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I catch you again, I will not be as merciful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:33.29,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958.667,508)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already taken over this area and all the chokepoints.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come here again or dare to resist,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you and tear you into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.31,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.667,514.667)}Lady Zhùróng
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The King has returned! Open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You only lost because you didn't listen to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory and defeat are commonplace in wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, no need for worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.98,0:08:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If Zhuge Liang dares to come here, I'd like to challenge him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Show those Shu men the strength of us Southerners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan to resist them, there is no need to bother yourself, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.57,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, you are to hold this ravine and defend against any Shu attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, if they dare to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.80,0:09:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,this place shall be their graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, urgent report!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo is back in Yinkeng Ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent gifts to the other tribes in return for tens of thousands of armed warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.55,0:09:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They are coming to challenge us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where are they now? \N-They're approaching the Xi'er River now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:10:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders! Encamp on both banks of the river, \N have our saber infantry on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang, come out and meet your match!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.72,0:11:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, I can go wipe all of them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my order,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,all men retreat back to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo is eager for a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we were to engage in battle, there would be heavy casualties regardless of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have captured him three times without killing him
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so we may capture his heart, not destroy his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:12:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is to remain on guard for a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,till his ferocity dies down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we will capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,In three days, I will have a plan ready for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He will throw himself into the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, go send someone to the Shu camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out why it's all quiet inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, scout out the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, Shu men!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:13:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Out, Shu men!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.78,0:14:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The camp is empty, report to the king at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-My king! \N-Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-My king, this camp is empty!\N -It's empty! It's empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,King Brother, Zhuge Liang has abandoned the camp so suddenly. It may be a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Something urgent must have happened at Chengdu, and they had to leave overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if Zhuge Liang had a trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:15:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,he would have left the camp in a mess to make us think they fled in a great hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But now the camp is as it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,even the grain fodder and baggage all remain intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a national emergency that forced him to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's either an invasion from Wu, or an attack from Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,King Brother has thought this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a Heaven-sent chance indeed. We can't afford to miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, pursue Zhuge Liang. \NWe shall cross the Xi'er River!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When the river is crossed, the army will advance down three routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The left and right wing will attack the enemy on their flanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lead the center into the enemy's main camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must end this quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter the camps before the enemy sees us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother! The Shu army is approaching our rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,The Shu army is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've fallen into Zhuge Liang's trap again! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're lucky to get away, otherwise I'd be caught once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:20.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646,62)}Capture Meng Huo alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.68,0:18:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo, I have waited for you here for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Such vicious tricks have shamed me thrice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thrice been caught and thrice the humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are caught here with nowhere to go, we will fight them to our last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut him and his chariot into pieces, to atone for this great shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We obey, my king!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him out, execute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother! Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What else do you want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, do you dare to set me free again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I dare?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If you set me free, I'll muster once again, and meet your challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Untie him and let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When you return this time, be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Study the books of strategy \Nand apply a good plan properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be caught again by me and regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.92,0:20:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, after fighting Chancellor Zhuge four times, we have been defeated every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that we can't withstand the Shu army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.98,0:20:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lived here for generations, ruling over Nanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't protect our homeland, I will have shamed myself before the very Heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My past defeats were all due to Zhuge Liang's cunning and wile,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will now tread carefully in our next match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I can die without regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu men are mighty warriors, and \NChancellor Zhuge is a savant in the art of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct engagement will not be to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you advise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortify and hold our defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now the height of summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:21:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat will rise, so we can hide in the dark gullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.54,0:21:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those men of Shu come from afar, exhausted from fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be tired and, under the blazing heat, they will have to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.39,0:21:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But they've penetrated deep into our territory\N and occupied many ravines. Where can we hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To the southwest from here, there is a place called Bald Dragon Ravines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Its chief, King Duosi, is a close friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can take refuge under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, we shall go to Bald Dragon Ravines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Great king, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty can rest assured,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,if Shu men intrude, I'll see to it that not a single one of them will go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They and Zhuge Liang will all die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you so certain, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:34.23,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(905.333,516)}Duǒsī Dàwáng \N(King Duǒsī)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are only two roads to this ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.29,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty just now came in from one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This road's soil is steady, its water sweet, and it can be traveled by men and horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we bar the way with barricades of wood and stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,not even an army of a million men could penetrate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.09,0:22:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the other road...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Water, water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:20.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Water! There's water here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.16,0:24:44.23,Thinking,,0,0,0,,That's much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.06,0:25:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.87,0:26:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are neither birds nor animals here.\NThis must be a place of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders, do not drink the water or enter the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.14,0:26:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from this pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.62,0:26:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.55,0:26:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...So, why even use Your Majesty's arms and men?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.01,0:26:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven is on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.68,0:26:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Zhuge Liang's cunning will be of no avail against these four springs of poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Come, drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.56,0:26:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:27:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My fury can now be calmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.06,0:27:07.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.333,518.667)}Jiǎng Wǎn\NStyled: Gōngyǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor. Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.44,0:27:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the scouts come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.16,0:27:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chancellor, they are all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only are there no signs of people, there aren't even any animals, so there is nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, there are neither birds nor beasts here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.54,0:28:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,how can there be any people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.58,0:28:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go farther in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.33,0:28:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.18,0:28:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.74,0:28:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Chancellor! There is a cottage over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.66,0:28:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go and ask for information?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.74,0:28:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.79,0:29:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.62,0:29:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}The late emperor Zhaolie entrusted the care of his heir to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.94,0:29:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Under the heir's imperial edict, I am now leading the army here to pacify the troubles of the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}But now Meng Huo has hidden and fortified in his ravines,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.94,0:29:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}and some of my men were poisoned from drinking the local water and cannot speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}Thus I wish to ask for your instructions, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}These are mere trifles, Chancellor need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:51.42,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Anle (安乐): Peace and happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}There is a water source nearby called the "Ānlè Spring."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}It is the antidote to this poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.19,0:29:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Please lead your poisoned men \Nto drink the water at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:30:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}and they will be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your compassion, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When General Wang arrives, tell them to drink the spring water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.71,0:30:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.30,0:30:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you didn't even ask who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.80,0:30:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not ask hermits choosing to live secluded in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.52,0:30:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Meng Huo's elder brother Meng Jie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.14,0:30:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}My second brother is stubborn and vicious, and refuses to accept the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.56,0:30:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}I've talked to him many times, but to no avail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.38,0:30:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}So I changed my name and retired into seclusion here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Now my younger brother bears arms against the Chancellor, forcing you to enter this barren frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.94,0:30:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}With so much trouble caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.96,0:31:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}I, as the eldest brother of a criminal, deserve only death to repay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.38,0:31:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Please, Chancellor, \Nforgive me for this mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.58,0:31:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to act like this, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you have captured my brothers several times without killing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.26,0:31:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,showing him so much mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.94,0:31:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but he refuses any reason and will keep mounting on his sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}This place is penetrated deep by miasma. \NMost of the springs are not drinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.06,0:31:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}Along the way, there are four poisonous springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.37,0:31:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}They are called the "Spring of Mute," the "Spring of Languor,"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}the "Black Spring," and the "Spring of Oblivion."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.07,0:32:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Drinking or bathing in these waters would kill or cripple you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.38,0:32:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}In addition, there is fetid air in these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Man, animal, bird, and beast alike \Nwill die immediately if they touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.09,0:32:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That means,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.38,0:32:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,my army cannot advance any farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.42,0:32:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}Chancellor need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.38,0:32:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}All those poisonous springs are caused by rotten grass, carcasses, and excrement.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.20,0:32:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Dig into the earth, and the water that comes out will be potable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.78,0:32:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}Thank you, sir, for your instruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.18,0:32:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Also, in front of my cottage grows a kind of herbal medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}called "leek-leafed rue."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.54,0:32:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,675)}You can tell your men to collect some.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.90,0:33:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Simply holding a leaf in the mouth protects against the miasma in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,With such valuable assistance, the armies and I know not of how to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.18,0:33:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It is only the right thing to do. The right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is the Anle Spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.14,0:33:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor! Thank you, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.72,0:33:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You should all thank this old master, it is he who saved your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.78,0:33:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He has freed our army from danger and disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.16,0:33:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, old master.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It is alright. It is alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:22.88,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the chieftain of Silver Leaf Ravine, Yang Feng,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.88,0:34:25.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,has irreconcilable enmity against Meng Huo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.18,0:34:28.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He will be able to help you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.10,0:34:41.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Yang Feng, Yang Feng...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.14,0:34:50.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(278.667,264)}Yáng Fēng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.60,0:34:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.18,0:34:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard that the Shu men have arrived here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.56,0:34:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so I've brought 30,000 of my veteran warriors here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.90,0:34:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens are on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:34:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.06,0:35:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chieftain Yang, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.11,0:35:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.12,0:35:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking alone is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.52,0:35:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought with me scores of dancing girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.92,0:35:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Their sword dance can be our entertainment for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.60,0:35:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.52,0:36:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.34,0:37:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no enmity against each other, why do you wish to harm me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.00,0:37:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.38,0:37:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My brothers and cousins all been saved by the Chancellor in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,yet you have no intention of amending your ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.38,0:37:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but instead throw the people of Nanzhong back into the misery of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.26,0:37:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I ought to offer you up to \NZhuge Liang to be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.76,0:37:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yang Feng, you're in my ravine! How dare you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.54,0:37:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think that all the men in this ravine would follow you to fight against the Shu men?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.58,0:37:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, most of the men in the ravine have surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.20,0:37:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who resisted have been tied up by us two brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.02,0:37:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go send someone to inform Chancellor Zhuge Liang,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send Meng Huo to him as a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.26,0:37:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.30,0:37:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.78,0:37:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are captured once again. \NWhat more can you say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.04,0:38:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The treachery of my own men has brought me to captivity,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.72,0:38:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,not your ability. How could I submit willingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.26,0:38:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You hid out in the ravine and had my men poisoned by the springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But now my soldiers are healed. Is this not the will of Heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.60,0:38:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,None of your men are willing to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.58,0:38:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You have lost the favor of your people!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.10,0:38:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you still refuse to come to your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.34,0:38:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me then if you'd like. Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.94,0:38:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we've captured him five times now, \Nand he still refuses to yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.53,0:38:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We should just kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.02,0:38:40.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.38,0:38:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Meng Huo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.71,0:38:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've raised arms and opposed the imperial army, endlessly troubling the people in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.51,0:38:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve death!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.82,0:39:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you live in the borderlands and \Nhave not adopted our ways, I pardoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.28,0:39:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Several times I capture you, \Nseveral times I set you free,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.94,0:39:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but you refuse to repent and keep warring against us. You fight and get defeated, and yet you fight again!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.64,0:39:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to force my hand to kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.70,0:39:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been defeated either by falling into your wily traps, or by my own people's treachery,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.65,0:39:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,not by the strength of your military.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.70,0:39:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can overcome and capture me in the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.64,0:39:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then I will yield to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.42,0:39:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How a defeated man dares to boast!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.70,0:39:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}My forefathers have long held the Silver Pit Mountains, with three rivers as our ramparts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.78,0:39:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}If you can fight me there, and capture me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,670)}then I will yield!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.92,0:39:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were not to let you go all out,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.96,0:39:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't surrender either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.42,0:39:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well! I'll set you free one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.68,0:39:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You may reorganize your armies to fight the decisive battle with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.62,0:40:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you become my prisoner again and refuse surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.89,0:40:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be put to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.52,0:40:46.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Dim grows the flashing of swords and daggers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.80,0:40:52.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}from afar do sound the battle drums and war horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.48,0:40:58.92,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Before my eyes rise only those
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.92,0:41:04.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}fresh faces, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:11.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Buried are the ancient paths and ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.24,0:41:16.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}desolate are the beacon fires and border towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.56,0:41:24.40,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}O, Years! You cannot take away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:28.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}that succession of familiar lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.56,0:41:35.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Who is it that determines what flourishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.68,0:41:42.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Is there no basis to prosperity and decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.08,0:41:48.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}In a single page, the storm disperses,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.04,0:41:54.12,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}reshaping space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.12,0:42:00.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Meeting and parting are always destined,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.44,0:42:06.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}separation and reunion always weighs in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.52,0:42:12.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Take the work of the living upon yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.52,0:42:18.96,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}unconcerned with your legacy after.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.96,0:42:25.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}The Yangtze has the will to transform into tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.08,0:42:31.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}the Yangtze has sentiment to raise its voice in song,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.24,0:42:37.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}in the firmament of history\N glimmers a sprinkling of stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.36,0:42:58.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}the spirit of heroism in the world\N thunders onward unbridled

